#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:3
msgid "Version 4.5.7"
msgstr "버전 4.5.7"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:5
msgid "Release Date: December 31, 2024"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2024년 12월 31일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:7
msgid "**4.5.7 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.5.7 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:15
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Common:** Fixed a bug where the ``helper()`` method may throw "
"`FileNotFoundException` on valid namespaced helper."
msgstr ""
"**Common:** 유효한 네임스페이스 헬퍼에서 ``helper()`` 메서드가 `FileNotFoundException`\ 을 던질 수 있던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Forge:** Fixed an issue where `SQLite3`'s Forge always returns `false` "
"when calling ``dropColumn()``."
msgstr ""
"**Forge:** `SQLite3`\ 의 Forge가 ``dropColumn()``\ 을 호출할 때 항상 `false`\ 를 반환하던 문제가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.5.7.rst:20
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
